  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali budget transfer to support Reproductive Health law reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer of budget from the EPD Support Programme to the British Embassy Bamako, Mali. This has been agreed to fund technical support, in conjunction with UNFPA Mali, to provide the evidence base for revision of Law No. 02-044 on reproductive health in Mali. The support has been agreed between the EPD Support Programme team, FCDO Mali health team and UNFPA Mali.</narrative>
  </description>
